      "rule": "The Pedlar's Pack, full set (3 pieces): each time a foe's health first falls below 75 %, 50 % and 25 %, the lamp draws a breath. You may spend a breath to cast a soul art again at once and at no cost. Once a fight, the cracked bell rings by itself and deals soul damage to you and the foe alike: the one breath not in the ledger.",
