      "approx": "fire_art skips soul_pct arts, so each 75/50/25 % threshold accelerates all own cooldowns by 4 s (timer which all) and makes the next soul art free (next_art_cost 0); below 50 % foe HP once per fight the cracked bell deals mutual soul free/self hits (c 0.45 / c 0.25).",
